WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Luke holds heavy Flash Knuckle before releasing it.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.350
Ryu parries the held heavy Flash Knuckle.

3
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.500
Luke catches Ryu with a normal throw after the parry.

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.850
The throw knocks Ryu down.
